1
00:00:03,541 --> 00:00:04,916
What did you just say?

2
00:00:05,541 --> 00:00:07,916
All of House
Carter’s lands have fallen!

3
00:00:13,625 --> 00:00:15,833
My lord… what is happening?

4
00:00:16,291 --> 00:00:18,333
Could Severin actually be behind this?

5
00:00:18,333 --> 00:00:18,916
No way.

6
00:00:18,916 --> 00:00:20,958
How could a miner
wield that kind of power?

7
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:24,250
Severin!

8
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,416
Stop right there!

9
00:00:35,041 --> 00:00:35,791
Severin,

10
00:00:42,083 --> 00:00:44,083
What the hell have
you done to our family?

11
00:00:44,291 --> 00:00:46,500
I just gave you
exactly what you asked for.

12
00:00:48,250 --> 00:00:49,500
This can’t be happening.

13
00:00:50,041 --> 00:00:51,708
A worthless failure like you

14
00:00:51,708 --> 00:00:53,583
couldn’t
possibly have this kind of power.

15
00:00:54,791 --> 00:00:56,250
Father, don’t fall for his lies!

16
00:00:56,625 --> 00:00:58,125
It has to be a coincidence.

17
00:00:59,250 --> 00:00:59,791
Exactly.

18
00:00:59,833 --> 00:01:02,500
How could a miner
destroy an entire noble house?

19
00:01:03,333 --> 00:01:04,708
If he were truly that powerful,

20
00:01:04,833 --> 00:01:06,291
why would he waste his life digging in the dirt?

21
00:01:06,291 --> 00:01:08,500
But our lands are
under attack right now!

22
00:01:09,083 --> 00:01:10,625
If we don't stop it immediately...

23
00:01:12,791 --> 00:01:15,166
House Carter will be completely erased

24
00:01:15,166 --> 00:01:16,916
from Golantis within days!

25
00:01:18,416 --> 00:01:20,083
Your new heir claims he knows

26
00:01:20,083 --> 00:01:21,916
Steward Jeyn of the Sovereign Sanctum.

27
00:01:22,833 --> 00:01:24,083
Go ask him for help.

28
00:01:24,875 --> 00:01:26,250
This should be easy for him.

29
00:01:27,125 --> 00:01:27,583
Right!

30
00:01:28,083 --> 00:01:29,791
I’ll contact Steward Jeyn right now!

31
00:01:29,916 --> 00:01:30,583
That's good.

32
00:01:32,250 --> 00:01:34,458
May House Carter flourish forever...

33
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:35,541
under his leadership.

34
00:01:35,625 --> 00:01:36,500
Severin!

35
00:01:37,083 --> 00:01:38,500
And I’ll be
sure to bring you

36
00:01:38,541 --> 00:01:40,416
a very special
gift for your wedding.

37
00:01:40,916 --> 00:01:42,125
I look forward to it.

38
00:01:47,083 --> 00:01:51,291
That stone… was it
really just a coincidence?

39
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,958
Father, he’s nothing
but a worthless miner!

40
00:01:55,666 --> 00:01:58,916
But… he was far too confident.

41
00:02:03,583 --> 00:02:05,625
Notify every branch
of the Sovereign Sanctum.

42
00:02:06,708 --> 00:02:09,083
No one is permitted to
have any dealings with House Carter.

43
00:02:09,916 --> 00:02:12,416
Disobey, and you will be executed.
